WEBVTT

00:02:57.286 --> 00:03:01.594
from a crisis, we never
come out the same --

00:03:01.618 --> 00:03:06.268
and it will take time,
and hard work, to overcome it.

00:03:06.704 --> 00:03:09.796
We will have to take it
one step at a time;

00:03:09.820 --> 00:03:13.370
help the weak; persuade those in doubt;

00:03:13.394 --> 00:03:16.046
imagine new solutions;

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.902
and commit to carry them out.

00:03:19.952 --> 00:03:21.866
Our goal is clear:

00:03:21.890 --> 00:03:26.299
to build, within the next decade,

00:03:26.323 --> 00:03:31.684
a world where we can meet the needs